    <string name="privacy_include_system">Include system apps</string>
    <string name="privacy_intro">Below is what apps can access, based on permissions reported by Android. A granted permission does not mean an app is dangerous — it may be needed for a feature. You can change it in settings at any time.</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_text">PHONEBOOST needs no account and does not send your personal data to any server. Device readings, the app list and permissions are read on your phone only. Access to photos and videos is requested only when you tap “Find large files”. The ad service (Google AdMob) may use its advertising ID, governed by Google’s policy.</string>
